    "owned": "A workstream may add, change, rename or delete the paths mapped to it.",
    "tests": "Any workstream may ADD a new test file (*.test.ts, *.test.tsx, *.test.mjs) anywhere. In an existing test file it does not own it may only add lines (0 deleted lines); a changed or removed expectation there needs an integrator grant and is listed with its reason (DoC-1 C1).",
